values ('6d1f0a00-0000-4000-8000-000000002304', '$z_1 z_2 = 5 + i$ និង $\dfrac{z_1}{z_2} = -\dfrac{1}{2} + \dfrac{5}{2}i$', null, null, null, '[{"content":"$z_1 z_2 = (2 + 3i)(1 - i) = 2 - 2i + 3i - 3i^2 = 2 + i + 3 = 5 + i$"},{"content":"គុណភាគយក និងភាគបែងនឹងកុំផ្លិចឆ្លាស់ $1 + i$៖ $\\dfrac{z_1}{z_2} = \\dfrac{(2 + 3i)(1 + i)}{(1 - i)(1 + i)}$"},{"content":"$= \\dfrac{2 + 2i + 3i + 3i^2}{2} = \\dfrac{-1 + 5i}{2} = -\\dfrac{1}{2} + \\dfrac{5}{2}i$"}]'::jsonb, 'demo', 'Written for Meh Rean as demo practice content. Not an official MoEYS BacII paper.', 'provisional')
