values ('6d1f0a00-0000-4000-8000-000000002404', 'អតិបរមាធៀប $f(-1) = 2$ និងអប្បបរមាធៀប $f(1) = -2$', null, null, null, '[{"content":"$f''(x) = 3x^2 - 3 = 3(x - 1)(x + 1)$"},{"content":"$f''(x) > 0$ លើ $(-\\infty, -1)$ និង $(1, +\\infty)$៖ $f$ កើន។ $f''(x) < 0$ លើ $(-1, 1)$៖ $f$ ចុះ។"},{"content":"នៅ $x = -1$៖ $f(-1) = -1 + 3 = 2$ (អតិបរមាធៀប)។ នៅ $x = 1$៖ $f(1) = 1 - 3 = -2$ (អប្បបរមាធៀប)។"}]'::jsonb, 'demo', 'Written for Meh Rean as demo practice content. Not an official MoEYS BacII paper.', 'provisional')
